  "terrainName": "basic-desert",
  "description": "What: the dragon's STRAFE (CE-3490 BA-1\u2026BA-3, docs/designs/air-attack/DESIGN_Breath_Attack.md). On basic-desert a 'Dragon' (TKB 411) 60 m up at (100, 300) is ordered AirPlatformAttack on 'Squad Man 1'; the squad (four riflemen, Hostile, holding) stands in a north-south row at x 400, y 288\u2026312; 'Far Man 1/2' stand 200 m north at (400\u2026406, 520). Judge: the dragon breathes; it comes down below 20 m to breathe; the squad men burn and Squad Man 1 dies; after the first man burns the dragon climbs back above 50 m (out and round for another pass); the far men are never hurt."
 },
